{"ts":"2026-07-06T21:08:48.035Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"GitHub: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/469\n\n## Problem\nWhen multiple npm global prefix paths exist, `pm --version` can show a stale version even after `npm install -g @unbrained/pm-cli@latest` — agents conclude the upgrade failed or operate against an old surface.\n\n## Proposed fix\nDetect and warn about PATH-shadowed pm binaries (compare active binary path vs installed package), either at --version/doctor time or via a postinstall verification."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-sqf7"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"GH-469: pm --version reports a stale binary when multiple npm global prefixes exist"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Dogfood GH-469: with multiple npm global prefixes (~/.npm-global + homebrew), pm --version can show a stale version even after npm install -g @unbrained/pm-cli@latest. Duplicate check: searched stale version npm global prefixes — no existing item."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent-experience","gh-issue","install","onboarding"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-06T21:08:48.035Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-06T21:08:48.035Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"maintainer-agent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":120},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"pm --version (or pm doctor) detects multiple global installs / PATH-shadowed binaries and warns with the active binary path; or postinstall verifies the active pm on PATH matches the installed package"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-u9d0"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/reporter","value":"unbraind"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/repro_steps","value":"1. Have two npm global prefixes on PATH (e.g. ~/.npm-global and homebrew). 2. npm install -g @unbrained/pm-cli@latest into one prefix. 3. pm --version resolves the stale binary from the other prefix."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"pm --version reflects the just-installed package, or warns that the active binary path does not match the installed package"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"pm --version silently reports the old version resolved from a different npm global prefix"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"087addf190c5894c7dc51ebcbf17734c98ee1fd29481e01b81ac8adce55eaee5","message":""}
